Grammar time! You should or shouldn't + verb. Listen. You should protect your password. You shouldn't share personal information.

14
00:01:32.363 --> 00:01:40.080
Your turn. Say it with me. You should protect your password. You shouldn't share personal information.

15
00:01:45.387 --> 00:02:06.934
Being a good digital citizen means acting responsibly online. Everything you post becomes part of your digital footprint, so it's important to think before sharing. Protecting your privacy with a strong password, treating others with respect, and standing against cyberbullying are all part of online safety. Always verify information before believing or sharing it.

